O                0.7441030531        0.3739261890        0.5936478751
O                0.7453188053        0.6178948029        0.1076480943
O                0.2546811947        0.6178948029        0.3923519057
O                0.2126941318        0.8973782440        0.9361733634
O                0.7873058682        0.8973782440        0.5638266366
O                0.7765551870        0.1053351426        0.0635245092
O                0.2234448130        0.1053351426        0.4364754908

K_POINTS automatic
12 12 12 1 1 1

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   4.6287441398   0.0000000000   0.0084495082
   0.0000000000   5.6461489805   0.0000000000
  -0.0390476794   0.0000000000   4.9409183975

HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
U Mn-3d 4.65
U Ni-3d 8.55
